  extrapolated over all 220 cores: ~1.49e+08 quadruples pass the necessary condition
  (each needs a 4-way bitmask OR + covering test)

### verdict on feasibility ###
  passing quadruples ~ 1.49e+08 ; at ~3e5 tests/sec in Python that is ~0.1 hours
  brute force (no pruning) would be ~2e9 per the raw count, so the prune helps by ~13x
DONE
